  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19937c6dea3609dc",
      "translationZh": "SlopSoup TV 是一个实时播出、永不停歇的像素艺术电视网络。每一份剧本、每一个角色、每一段配音、每一次镜头切换以及每一项节目排期决策，都由模型完成。它被刻意设计得极其荒诞、阴暗而古怪。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c82fe859cfe30a2",
      "translationZh": "硬件：一个 Hugging Face Space，16 vCPU，无 GPU。下述所有组件都在 CPU 上运行，与一个实时 x264 编码器并行工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d33d88dc0e9fc168",
      "translationZh": "LLM（通过 HF API 调用），按层级路由，并设有提供商故障回退机制和各提供商独立的冷却时间：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ff5b2a55033c640d",
      "translationZh": "节目统筹（故事设定、大纲）：GLM-5.3，以 Kimi-K3 和 Qwen3.8 作为备用模型。也可以在本地使用 MLX/GGUF 替代任意模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "aaf6beac2566c53f",
      "translationZh": "编剧（剧本）：GLM-5.3-Flash",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "374a6d7f64122ff4",
      "translationZh": "评审：gpt-oss-120b，依据一份书面规则进行评审",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "791d3f3c9efefd41",
      "translationZh": "视觉：Gemma 4 为野生动物实时摄像画面提供解说",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9cb36751432a8313",
      "translationZh": "预算：设置以美元计的每日支出上限，并采用逐级降级机制（先使用更便宜的层级，再切换到较少依赖 LLM 的内容，最后采用程序化生成）。部署并运行后的实际支出约为 2 美元/天。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "58b7075c2ceeb545",
      "translationZh": "文本转语音：Qwen3-TTS 1.7B（GGUF，Q8_0）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b8ca37d036ea943d",
      "translationZh": "情绪库：为每个角色准备不同情绪的演绎版本（愤怒、悲伤、低语……）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df78bf7a86c86567",
      "translationZh": "避免 24/7 持续输出变得千篇一律：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "de063fa5a480b54b",
      "translationZh": "新颖性台账：使用 BGE-small ONNX 嵌入向量配合余弦相似度门控，以及用于主题和姓名等的精确键。任何内容都不会播出两次。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "330a40c8391b305e",
      "translationZh": "编剧室审稿环节：一个低成本模型为每份草稿评分（好笑、新鲜、古怪），并重写最薄弱的台词；这些重写后的内容会再次经过同样的防护检查。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "51ab6116afcd4e37",
      "translationZh": "真实性防护：一条“事实”台词中的每个数字和真实姓名，都必须出现在有来源依据的事实中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee9f018bfbde01c5",
      "translationZh": "渲染通过无头 Chromium 中的自定义 canvas 渲染器完成（虚拟摄像机、口型同步特写、骨架绑定动画）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d212f2c4098b8d9f",
      "translationZh": "去看看，好让你判断自己到底讨不讨厌它：https://severian-slopsoup.hf.space 或 https://youtube.com/live/Bikb9JGy6vg?feature=share",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d98542ab8072d56f",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/vesudeva 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
